// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable Group - depends_on_Person Var Name - INTRODUCTION_STRING 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P608936192" "That's a coded message from your Broker. A girl named Jane Adatta has been selling secrets to the {VillainGroup}, and there's a reward on her head."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1503181264" "The {VillainGroup} raided a local tech firm called Aerodyne Avionics and made off with one of their lead researchers. Publicly, Aerodyne make airplane parts. Privately, they supply tech to groups like the Sky Raiders and even Arachnos. Whatever Dr. Howard knows is probably worth a fortune."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P4246635697" "Arvin Armanents is the company that originally designed the Warburg rockets. Sounds like they have something new. It wouldn't be too hard for someone of your ability to break into their base and take their plans."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1062933714" "The doctor may not know it, but messing with time is a big no-no in the Rogue Isles. Lord Recluse has quietly made that very clear. If you were to bring this guy to Arachnos, they'd definitely look favorably on you."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2242469688" "That's news to you. The reporter here is Nellie Fine. Wonder what her angle is in making people think you're dead?"
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P813892213" "Jenny Hise is a nurse at Black Heart hospital. You remember her because she treated you last time you were there. You have a sneaking suspicion that someone took her to get your blood sample."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P208913759" "Jake Emmet is the lead designer on a computer game called 'Freedom Phalanx'. It's gone gold and looks set to sell a half-million copies. That really ticks you off. Time to teach this nerd a lesson."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2052626832" "A four-eyed pencil-pusher named Dr. Plotnik recently ran from the {VillainGroup} through the streets of Port Oakes. They caught the little runt after tearing up Dockside and are holding him somewhere. If they were desperate enough to be that public about catching him, he must know something worthwhile."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1385345437" "The {VillainGroup} snatched a real estate agent named Natalie Brooks. Why would they care about a realtor? Something's fishier than Captain Mako here."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1658917452" "This uptight shrink has analyzed you for a series on notable villains in the Protector. She says your violent tendencies stem from an unhappy childhood and feelings of inadequacy, and that you suffer from extreme intimacy issues. Words do not describe the rage welling inside you."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2217706722" "A loser named Perry Millner has been squealing to Longbow. The {VillainGroup} got him first. Nab him and the reward should be quite large."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3748064960" "Camille Henri is tied to the Luddites. You've heard rumors she's the sister of their leader, Martin Henri himself. The {VillainGroup} have her now, but if you took her from them you could sell her to the Luddites' enemies."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P4113937159" "A scrawny little jerk named Haxx0r created a nifty little virus that spread through the isles like wildfire. If you captured him and took the code for yourself it'd be worth a small fortune."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3553753873" "Stealing high-tech secrets from Crey is risky business, so you doubt Herman Lewis was actually a janitor. More likely he was a spy working for the {VillainGroup}. Those jokers have been after some of Crey's tech for some time now. You know where they're likely hiding Herman. If you were to catch him, you could find out just what so valuable, or turn him over to Crey for a fat reward."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P697629224" "Aeon pretends to be Cap au Diable's benign benefactor, but you know better. This new lab of his is a front for something sinister. Maybe something you can use for yourself."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3728055634" "Dr. Elissa Montrose is a famous scientist specializing in super-sonics as weapons. Arachnos just gave her a huge grant. That means she's probably developed a new super-weapon for the spiders, and you want it."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P37665779" "Aeon Hydroponics pretends to grow giant-sized foods to better the world, but that's just a front. Everyone knows it's actually a cloning farm. One of the clones has become sentient and escaped. Whoever brings it back will definitely find favor with Lord Recluse."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P359358435" "Yuk. The {VillainGroup} injected some poor sap with an experimental drug. He escaped and wound up in a hospital, then whacked and orderly and escaped again. The victim is doomed, but whatever toxin is running through his system might be interesting. If you can find him before the {VillainGroup} do."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3475509482" "The article talks about Paul Sanchez, a local who used to be a superhero named Gigabyte. He's in hiding here now, but your people should be able to find him. If he's still got his old gadgets, they'd be quite valuable."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2663931619" "Guy Dylan is a playboy by day, but the villain known as Mercury by night. Most think he got busted by Longbow, but your sources say the {VillainGroup} have him."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2048089928" "Giovani Morricone is a brilliant inventor who's been researching nanotech for years. Most villains won't touch him because he's got protection from Aeon, but if he's close to unveiling working nanotech, it might be worth grabbing him and his secrets after all."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P752549088" "Razorbeam was a high-tech villain who fired narrow 'slices' of light from his eyebeam. It was said they buried him with his eyebeam, but your sources say that's not true. While every other villain group stakes out the cemetary, you can find his daughter, who you think is about to step into her dad's boots."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1820639342" "It's a coded message. Fortunately, your Broker told you how to break it. In the classifieds is a message from Black Scorpion. He's looking for a high-tech inventor to make improvements on his power armor. Find him one and he'll pay handsomely."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1829670421" "Dr. Ilya Schevnisky wrote a Nobel-prize winning book on space travel. Looks like someone wanted her expertise. You'd love to find out why."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1871819514" "Cap City Croaker lead singer Emil Wicked was last seen with a gorgeous young groupie. From the description, she sounds like a sometimes operative for the {VillainGroup}. If so, they took Wicked and you know where. Little jerk is probably worth something if you keep him alive."

