// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P3652669684" "Look, I told you all I know. The access code is--did you hear something?"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P869242603" "Don't threaten me, youngster. King Midas is a personal friend. Who do you think builds the Goldbrickers' jet packs?"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P744847301" "The blueprints aren't here anymore. I swear!"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P2982545187" "I swear I didn't know Lord Recluse had declared time travel off-limits!"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P256476662" "Don't hurt me."
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P1848188244" "Yeah, I got the blood sample. It wasn't easy though."
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P1693633037" "Get your hands off me. Positron is a personal friend, you know?"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P2442697809" "Arachnos doesn't tell us WHAT they want it for. They just order the devices. I have no idea what they'd need a psychic amplifier for!"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P4220081490" "Mr. Webb bought Lee Towers. That's all I know! Well, okay, there was some construction scheduled for the basement, but I don't know the details."
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P597969744" "Yes, {VillainName} probably suffers from delusions of grandeur as well."
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P3193747813" "I haven't told anyone anything. I don't even know anything!"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P2653443656" "Look, this is the third time this month. Martin is my brother, but I don't know anything about what he's doing."
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P2830253173" "Everybody wants my code, jerk. What's your offer?"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P183268788" "It was getting too hot. I had to make my play before the Countess figured out what I was doing."
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P3996443911" "We're working on a video monitor that hooks directly into a person's brain. That's all I know. I don't know what he wants with it."
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P3349260685" "No. And if you harm one hair on my head, Black Scorpion himself will hunt you down and destroy you."
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P1112849802" "I'm not a clone! I'm David Wilson from Blacksburg, Virginia! I have no idea how I wound up here in the Rogue Isles!"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P785165261" "...so...hot...fever..."
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P531325965" "Our fight ended a long time ago. I don't even wear the cape anymore."
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P2372719339" "You have no idea who you're messing with, idiot."
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P3660009895" "Hear that buzzing in your ears? Heh heh. Too late, dolt. The nanites have infected your brain."
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P1444430341" "It's mine. Touch me and die!"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P3436581783" "You want me to WHAT? Work on Black Scorpion's suit?"
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P456584949" "The Rikti don't come from 'outer space', you idiot. They come from a parallel universe."
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P2705649799" "Yeah, I can probably figure out what the wailers are sayin'. If you can get me my equipment."

