// Script Variable HOSTAGE_ACTIVE_STRING :
"P2786249591" "Oh no. This is a major 404 error."
// Script Variable HOSTAGE_ACTIVE_STRING :
"P1637159944" "Ha. {VillainName}. I'm sure you're not here to rescue me, but teach these creeps a lesson and I'll make it worth your while."
