// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P1375043690" "You programmed the system and this is all you know? I think not."
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P1173528372" "We need those new rocketpacks, old man. You'd better cough up the design, pronto."
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P4234205555" "Where are the blueprints, Mr. Crow? We have need of that rocket."
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P3825815717" "You made a big mistake. Recluse has been very clear about anyone messing with time. He's got something going on and doesn't want some two-bit nerd like you messing it up."
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P2068185185" "Your expose of our operation was most troubling, Ms. Fine."
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P375909720" "This blood will allow us to create an army modeled after {VillainName}. We will be unstoppable."
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P126813209" "Your idiotic game says Positron humiliated the {VillainGroup} in the Diamatrix Plot last year. That's ridiculous. Everyone knows it was a faulty regulator on the device that defeated us!"
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P2837119604" "I want the complete inventory of what Arachnos ordered from you, Dr. Plotnik. Now."
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P3487780247" "Foolish girl. Mr. Webb is an alias for Arachnos' agents. Now why did they purchase a building in Paragon City?"
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P1206446512" "Here's your money. Tell me about {VillainName}'s weakness. Is there something we can use to bring this insufferable fool down for good?"
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P382719745" "Tell us what you told Longbow and I'll make it quick."
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P1419687263" "Your brother has caused us quite a bit of trouble, girl."
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P1667863387" "How did you circumvent Longbow's systems? That is what I truly want to know."
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P2167288876" "It took five years to get you in that position. And you leave with little more than a transdimensional device blueprint?"
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P3183996316" "Why did I see a fortunata come out of this building?"
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P2715901957" "Come work for us. We'll triple what Arachnos is paying you."
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P1910267220" "There is a reward for you dead or alive. I suggest you do not tempt us."
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P4091220602" "There you are, Mr. Degner. Come back to the lab now."
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P936739053" "It's been 8 years since you put me away, Gigabyte. But I haven't forgotten. Nor forgiven."
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P3582321248" "You're Mercury? I sweat we didn't know! We were just after some of your industrial secrets. Sorry, Mr. Mercury! Very sorry!"
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_STRING :
