// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P3514214824" "All we want is your father's eyebeam, girl. You can keep the rest of that junk he created."
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P510374999" "Black Scorpion has need of your services, and we have need of his favor. Come with us."
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_STRING :
"P4027307051" "The rikti aren't aliens?"
// Script Variable CAPTOR_INACTIVE_STRING :
