"P3114492239" "Keep it quiet. We don't want anyone to know we're here."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4247828929" "Surely you know more than that, {PERSON_NAME}."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2023397325" "What's the matter? Did you hear something?"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3256818623" "Tell me again about {VillainName}."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P815679204" "Lord Recluse once told me a great secret. He said that the secret of Cap au Diable is--wait, did you hear that?"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3944897955" "It's not the capes I'm worried about. We can handle some idiot do-gooder. It's the villains you have to watch out for. They're nuts."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3681470889" "Tell me more. Or else."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3609140809" "That's it? Are you sure that's all you know?"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2191962922" "I would hate to think you're lying to us."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2765520336" "...or I'll have your blood turned to dust. You have no idea how painful that is."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1313302837" "Protect {PERSON_NAME}! Nothing else matters."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1424489055" "You'll pay for your interference, {VillainName}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3161545973" "{VillainName}! How did you find us? No matter. You'll pay for it now!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P22350423" "Stop {VillainName}! This will ruin everything!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3374251717" "What a pleasant surprise. {VillainName}. I've been wanting to kill you for some time."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1184280231" "That's unexpected. No matter. Deal with it."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1570792195" "{VillainName}. You're late. I expected you sooner."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2363790294" "{VillainName}? This isn't what you think..."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3335483991" "I knew I heard something. Kill {VillainName}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P469149989" "Ack! You! What are you doing here?"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1409950885" "I hate it when a plan falls apart."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2956381360" "{VillainName}. I heard you were dead. Or turned into a pile of sentient nanites under control of Dr. Aeon. I can't remember."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P1845150365" "You can smell mayhem. Mmm. You love the smell of mayhem in the morning. And in the day, at night--."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P1142214865" "{Person_Name} is in here somewhere. You just have to find the target and eliminate anyone who gets in your way."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P3319858964" "This is what the {VillainGroup} calls home? Hard times, man. Hard times."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P1767210508" "It was a long way here and you're in a bad mood. Perhaps you can vent some steam on the {VillainGroup}."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P1544063203" "What great security the {VillainGroup} have. Idiots didn't even post door guards."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P1919309231" "There's a certain satisfaction in decimating a group of morons so incompetent they don't even post guards at the front door."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P725156910" "'Anybody home? {VillainName} is here, and I'm NOT happy.'"
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P3167228075" "'Knock, knock. Pizza guy. Anybody order a pizza with extra pain?"
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P969288471" "Some days you're just irritated. This is one of those days. It's not the {VillainGroup}'s fault, but they're gonna soothe your savage beast with their faces."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P2281226568" "'One, two, {VillainName}'s comin' for you...'"
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P2820754017" "'You idiots deserve everything I'm gonna do to you. You didn't even lock the front door."
// Script Variable SAYONRESCUE_STRING :
"P1025096355" "Hey, it's {VillainName}. Oh man."
// Script Variable SAYONRESCUE_STRING :
"P795959435" "Oh, this can't be good."
// Script Variable SAYONRESCUE_STRING :
"P1618150781" "Look, {VillainName}. Let's make a deal."
// Script Variable SAYONRESCUE_STRING :
"P2250046251" "If you let me go I'll make it worth your while!"
// Script Variable SAYONRESCUE_STRING :
"P4006852640" "So--how about we make some sorta deal. You let me go, I keep my mouth shut, everyone's happy."
// Script Variable SAYONRESCUE_STRING :
"P1176408866" "I thought you were here to rescue me, not kidnap me."
// Script Variable SAYONRESCUE_STRING :
"P1501496429" "I wasn't working with these guys, {VillainName}! I just happened to be at the wrong place at the wrong time."
// Script Variable SAYONRESCUE_STRING :
"P572046333" "I do NOT want to leave with {VillainName}. Do something you idiots!"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P2861125104" "What's the rush, {VillainName}?"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P2233900393" "I'm coming. Don't get your leotards in a bunch."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P205893785" "Bite me. I'll get there when I get there. You can't kill me or you already would have."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P1224721445" "On my way. Sorry. Please don't hurt me!"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P942413271" "Sorry. It's like a freakin' maze in here."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P549197824" "You want me to run? I might fall and break my neck. Then how much would I be worth to you?"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P3547479520" "Get off my back, {VillainName}. I'll get there."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P2246979158" "Yeah--I just--got lost."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P4161638680" "Sorry. Hadda use the bathroom back there. All this excitement."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P299123448" "You got a hot date or something? I'm coming."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P2320174172" "Bet you wouldn't be so brave if there was a cape around."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P2872982137" "Lemme outta here!"
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P2301215775" "Where to now?"
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P2253885502" "Can we talk about this?"
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P990261599" "How much to say you never found me?"
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P3487791079" "Can't we all just get along?"

